  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1720155432_5477913_c80c43ae937e67227383e18dfd05fee5.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"><span>Eucalyptus silk pillowcases &amp; sleep masks for faster, longer-lasting sleep.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"><span>Eucalyptus silk pillowcases &amp; sleep masks for faster, longer-lasting sleep.</span>Our products are ultra-soft, hypoallergenic &amp; anti-aging, keeping your skin protected and hydrated.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Our unique design caters to all types, whether you're a side, back or stomach sleeper.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>We offer products that are eco-friendly, responsibly sourced eucalyptus silk products.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Masterfully designed Sleep Mask with 100% light blockage for an uninterrupted slumber.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payments will be made via paypal on the last working day of the month that follows the month in which the transaction was made.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">E.G. A transaction that is processesd the 05/07/24 will be paid out on the 29/08/24.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">please contact Gary@rodigital.com.au if you have any further questions.